    "description": {
      "content": "APIs for buy now pay later services with embedded Explainable AI for automated decisioning and credit offer matching. Supports interest-free and interest-bearing BNPL products with point-of-sale integration and full loan lifecycle management. Core banking agnostic and deployable on Temenos Banking Cloud.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Temenos Developer Support\n Email: api.support@temenos.com",
